ight.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"614\" height=\"104\" /></span></p>\n<p>獲得飛行能力</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/506/679/2022-10-15_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\" /></p>\n<blockquote>Permission - Feel free to use in your modpacks.</blockquote>\n<p>點擊下方橫幅立即取得你的伺服器！或前往<a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\">BisectHosting.com</a>，並確保使用代碼'<strong>gamerpotion</strong>'以獲得25%折扣。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/608/745/bisect-banner-large3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"621\" height=\"415\" /></a></p>",
